@format 1
@id section-creation.common.forward-section-plan
@title Forward section plan
@section Section creation
@area Common
@entry add-plan-request
@summary Build the new forward-running unnamed section used by Add and by Set Start when Set Start chooses its creation branch.
@related section-creation.add-at-cursor, section-creation.set-start-creates-section, section-creation.common.apply-created-state
@tag section
@tag split
@tag creation
@tag planning

@alias piece = Cadroue.Core.LPiece

[add-plan-request] LPieceAdd request <input>
= The caller supplies the current section list, cursor, media duration, color index, and the current overlap-allowed preference.
> duration-check

[duration-check] Cursor is before media end <decision>
- LPieceAdd rejects a cursor at or beyond the media duration @ piece.LPieceAdd(...)
? "Cursor at or beyond duration" > duration-rejected
? "Cursor before duration" > occupied-check

[duration-rejected] No section plan <output>
= No section is created.

[occupied-check] Cursor occupancy <decision>
- When overlap is disabled, reject a cursor inside another section; when overlap is allowed LPieceInsideCheck always permits it @ piece.LPieceInsideCheck(...)
? "Blocked by existing section" > occupied-rejected
? "Allowed" > end-limit

[occupied-rejected] No section plan because cursor is occupied <output>
= No section is created.

[end-limit] Determine the new section end <process>
- Use media duration as the ceiling; when overlap is disabled, clamp the end to the nearest later section start @ piece.LPieceLimitRead(...)
> span-check

[span-check] Positive section span <decision>
- LPieceAdd requires the computed end to be later than the cursor @ piece.LPieceAdd(...) / end check
? "End is not later than cursor" > span-rejected
? "Positive span" > append-plan

[span-rejected] No section plan because span is empty <output>
= No section is created.

[append-plan] Append a new unnamed section <process>
- Append LPiece(cursor, computed end, color index, empty name) and select the newly appended last index @ piece.LPieceAdd(...) / accepted plan
> map:section-creation.common.apply-created-state
